Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.47,0:00:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Kim Soo-hyun - Kim Ji-won{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.95,0:00:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Park Sung-hoon - Kwak Dong-yeon - Lee Joo-bin{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.55,0:00:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Kim Gab-soo - Lee Mi-sook{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.63,0:00:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Jung Jin-young - Na Young-hee{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.66,0:00:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Jeon Bae-soo - Hwang Young-hee{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.68,0:00:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Kim Jung-nan - Kim Joo-ryoung{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.73,0:00:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Jang Yoon-ju - Kim Do-hyun{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.13,0:00:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Screenwriter: Park Ji-eun{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.00,0:00:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Mga Direktor: Jang Young-woo - Kim Hee-won{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.14,0:01:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Reyna ng Luha{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.85,0:01:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Apat na Taon ang Nakaraan{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.98,0:01:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Episode 3{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.98,0:01:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Pagmamay-ari namin ang buong halamanan na ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.33,0:01:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Akala ko nandito ang nanay ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.04,0:01:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Baka nasa tindahan siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.62,0:01:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Nagpapatakbo din siya ng tindahan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.59,0:01:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Sinabi ko sa iyo na ang aming pamilya ay\Maimpluwensya sa bayang ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.55,0:01:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Tama.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.36,0:02:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Nay!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.78,0:02:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Nanay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.29,0:02:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Yongdu-ri Supermarket{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.62,0:02:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Sus.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.75,0:02:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Wala rin siya dito.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.84,0:02:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Pumili ng kahit anong gusto mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.60,0:02:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Magkaroon nito.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.81,0:02:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Ito ay isang bagong lasa.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.19,0:02:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Ice Pop{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.44,0:02:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Ito ay strawberry flavored.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.94,0:02:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Bumili ng isa ang lahat ng bata pagkatapos ng\Nschool, dahil sikat na sikat ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.84,0:03:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Ito ay mabuti at nakakapreskong.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.89,0:03:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,First time ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.35,0:03:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,First time mong magkaroon ng ice pop?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.64,0:03:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Maghintay. Siguro hindi bilang isang matanda, ngunit bilang isang bata?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.94,0:03:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ka ba binilhan ng nanay mo?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.32,0:03:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi, hindi niya ginawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.49,0:03:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,To be honest, medyo alam ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.15,0:03:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Alam mo ba kung ano?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.17,0:03:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Palagi kang nagsusuot ng mga t-shirt na may mga butas sa mga ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.29,0:03:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.59,0:03:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Iyan ay vintage.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.59,0:03:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ginawa ko sila sa Europe...\N- Ang suot mo ngayon ay parang...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.72,0:03:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,, bagay na isusuot ng lola ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.72,0:03:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi, pakinggan mo muna ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.35,0:03:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Magugulat ka kapag nalaman mo...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.39,0:03:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,ang presyo ng cardigan na ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.15,0:03:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hindi mo kailangang magpanggap sa akin.\N- Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.36,0:03:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ako ganoon kahirap.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.32,0:04:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Talaga.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.53,0:04:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Sa halip, dapat kang magtiwala sa akin.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.11,0:04:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Ibinibigay ko sa iyo ang aking salita.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.49,0:04:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Mula sa sandaling ito,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.58,0:04:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hahayaan kitang tamasahin ang lahat ng\Nbagay na hindi mo ma-enjoy sa buhay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.54,0:04:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi iyon magiging madali.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.00,0:04:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Diba sabi ko sayo naupahan ang apartment ko?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.97,0:04:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Ginawa mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.89,0:04:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Ngunit marami pa.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.85,0:04:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,To be honest,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.85,0:04:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagtitipid ako ng $2000 bawat buwan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.78,0:04:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Wag mo akong tingnan na parang hindi mo naiintindihan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.20,0:04:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ako nagyayabang.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.49,0:04:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Sabi ko okay lang.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.99,0:04:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Wala akong pakialam kung may utang ang pamilya mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.04,0:04:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Kung may utang tayo?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.00,0:05:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Kahit na higit pa riyan,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.67,0:05:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Wala akong pakialam.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.59,0:05:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Dahil...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.10,0:05:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Sasama ako sa iyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.10,0:05:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Sasama ka sa akin?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.19,0:05:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.52,0:05:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Pupunta ako diyan...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.11,0:05:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,para sa iyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.33,0:05:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Bakit nag-pop up ang memoryang ito?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.58,0:05:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ikaw ba ang huling tao sa isip ko...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.79,0:05:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}kung namatay ako ngayon?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.50,0:06:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay ka lang?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.26,0:06:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.60,0:06:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Nasaktan ka ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.60,0:06:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay ka lang?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.19,0:06:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Maaari mo bang tapusin dito?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.77,0:06:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Mukhang nagulat siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.44,0:06:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Kailangan niya ng pahinga.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.24,0:06:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Tara na.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.37,0:06:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.30,0:07:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Parang surreal sa ospital,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.05,0:07:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,pero naisip ko talagang mamamatay ako doon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.52,0:07:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,sabi ko ulit sa sarili ko...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.60,0:07:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,na hindi ako mamamatay,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.57,0:07:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,kasi naramdaman ko...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.48,0:07:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,na-offend.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.96,0:07:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay ka lang?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.58,0:07:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I think na-sprain ka.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.14,0:07:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagdadrama na naman ba ako?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.10,0:08:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo, kung ito ay sa ibang araw,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.19,0:08:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,pero dahil nasugatan ako,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.48,0:08:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Sa tingin ko ito ay makatwiran.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.94,0:08:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.21,0:08:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ba madaling magsunog ng kahoy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.50,0:08:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Ngunit ito ay oak,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.09,0:08:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- kaya imposible?\N- Hindi, hindi,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.59,0:08:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,ngunit mas gusto ng mga camper na tulad ko ang plum tree kaysa oak.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.84,0:08:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang nasusunog na amoy ng plum ay tumatagos\Nito sa karne at ginagawa itong malasa.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.85,0:08:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. Sige na.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.68,0:08:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Sus, nakaka-nostalgic ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.77,0:08:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Naaalala ko noong nagpunta ako sa Africa.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.27,0:08:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Napuno ang twenties ko\Nng ligaw at barbarismo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.36,0:08:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Ibig mong sabihin kung paano ka nanatili...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.70,0:09:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,sa hotel buong\Nweek dahil sa mga lamok?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.12,0:09:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapat na ako sa ilang\Nnakatingin lang sa bintana.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.96,0:09:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.63,0:09:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- Usok lang.\N- Tama.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.93,0:09:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Sa tingin ko ang kahoy na ito ay mamasa-masa.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.30,0:09:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Kahit na ang pinaka bihasang camper\N walang magagawa tungkol dito.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.35,0:09:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,, Si Hyun-woo ay hindi mapili sa kahoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.89,0:09:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Galing siya sa kanayunan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.56,0:09:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi mo ako maikukumpara sa kanya na malamang...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.90,0:09:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,naglaro ng soccer sa mga hindi sementadong kalsada na may pantog ng baboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.48,0:09:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,May karanasan siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.73,0:09:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Sus, ikaw at ang iyong mga dahilan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.15,0:09:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Nasaan siya, nga pala?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.95,0:09:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Maaari kang huminto. Ipagawa mo na lang sa kanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.45,0:09:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi, kaya ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.66,0:09:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Soo-cheol, tama na. Maaari mong itigil.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.23,0:10:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Chamomile?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.90,0:10:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.03,0:10:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Pwede ka bang gumawa ng dalawa para sa amin ni chairman?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.49,0:10:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo naman.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.74,0:10:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit maagang bumalik si Itay sa halip na manghuli?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.12,0:10:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.16,0:10:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakipag-ugnayan sa akin ang dakilang shaman.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.08,0:10:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Tungkol saan?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.21,0:10:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Biglang nagtanong ang salamangkero kung nagpunta ang chairman.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.46,0:10:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- Paano niya nalaman?\N- No wonder na magaling siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.63,0:10:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Sinabi niya na ang chairman ay magiging\Nin panganib kung siya ay manghuli ngayon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.89,0:10:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaya ba bumalik siya agad?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.64,0:10:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo, pero at least magandang balita ito para kay Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.97,0:10:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Kunin niya ang kurso niya.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.56,0:10:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Nay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.65,0:10:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Nay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.06,0:10:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Nay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.40,0:10:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Nasugatan si Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.52,0:10:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano? Paano?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.61,0:10:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Narinig kong may nakilala siyang baboy-ramo habang nangangaso,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.11,0:11:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,pero hindi gaanong malala ang mga sugat niya. Hindi sila masama.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.49,0:11:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Kabutihan. Okay lang ba siya?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.04,0:11:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Paano mo nalaman?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.04,0:11:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Ikaw talaga ang pinakamahusay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.09,0:11:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang sinabi niya?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.26,0:11:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, maraming salamat.\Bibisitahin kita sa lalong madaling panahon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.26,0:11:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang sinabi niya?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.85,0:11:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Sumulpot ang dating asawa mo sa panaginip niya.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.73,0:11:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,May hawak siyang kutsilyo sa lugar ng pangangaso.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.98,0:11:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Gusto ka niyang isama.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.40,0:11:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Maaaring nasa libingan ka\Npanganib kung nanghuli ka ngayon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.36,0:11:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.41,0:11:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Matalino kang makinig sa akin at bumalik.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.29,0:11:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Huwag balewalain ang mga pamahiin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.79,0:11:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Mag-check in sa shaman\Nbago gumawa ng malalaking desisyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.00,0:11:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.72,0:12:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Diba tatawagan natin si Doctor Kim?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.73,0:12:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay lang ako. Na-sprain lang ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.69,0:12:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Iniligtas ni Hyun-woo ang iyong buhay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.61,0:12:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Akala ko hindi man lang siya\Nmakabaril ng ibon, kundi baboy-ramo?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.57,0:12:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagpapanggap lang siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.28,0:12:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,May experience na siguro siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.03,0:12:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Pinapuri mo lang ba siya?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.78,0:12:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Kailangan mo ng maraming karanasan para mahuli ang isa.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.16,0:12:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Makapal ang balat ng baboy, kaya\Kailangan mong pumunta sa tamang lugar.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.21,0:12:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Kung hindi, maaari itong maging mas mapanganib.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.00,0:12:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Eksakto. Salamat sa Diyos siya ay\Nlucky. Paano kung nagkulang siya?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.42,0:12:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Pag-isipan mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.30,0:12:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi siya dapat naging walang ingat bilang isang baguhan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.72,0:12:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Siya ay isang marine sa special guard team.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.64,0:12:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- Kilala siya sa shooting niya.\N- Talaga?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.14,0:12:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo, talaga.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.85,0:12:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Naiintindihan mo ba sa wakas\Ngaano ka naging tanga...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.31,0:12:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,upang mag-alok na turuan siya kung paano bumaril?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.28,0:13:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Isang bagay ang tiyak.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.74,0:13:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Wala ako dito ngayon\Kung nag-alinlangan siya kahit kaunti.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.28,0:13:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You lucky brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.74,0:13:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ano?\N- Nakikita ko sa matipuno niyang mga braso...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.33,0:13:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,na hindi niya ginugol ang lahat\Nkanyang mga taon sa pag-aaral lamang.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.00,0:13:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Paano mo masasabi?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.00,0:13:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Noong nasa kulungan ako,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.67,0:13:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,inabot niya sa akin ang kasunduan\Nwith those muscular arms,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.47,0:13:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,at sinabing, "Pakipirma ito,"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.43,0:13:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,at ang puso ko...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.47,0:13:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,fluttered.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.56,0:13:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- Tita.\N- Tita, halika na.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.65,0:13:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Napapahanga mo ako minsan, Hyun-woo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.52,0:13:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Paano mo napagdesisyunan iyon sa maikling sandaling iyon?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.94,0:13:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ko iniisip.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.99,0:13:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Ito ay likas.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.15,0:13:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Alam ng iyong instincts na hindi mo siya dapat hayaang mamatay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.62,0:13:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kailangan mong iligtas siya para mabago niya ang kanyang kalooban. Tama ba?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.75,0:13:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hello?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.52,0:14:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Nasaan si Hae-in?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.31,0:14:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Uminom siya ng meds at natulog.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.11,0:14:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Siguro nagulat siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.07,0:14:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ako makapaniwala dito.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.07,0:14:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, na-scan ko yung course kanina.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.36,0:14:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Napansin kong nakabukas ang bakod.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.74,0:14:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Naniniwala akong nakapasok sa butas na iyon ang nasugatang baboy-ramo\N.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.20,0:14:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Iyon daw ang course ni Chairman Hong.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.12,0:14:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang nakukuha mo?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.42,0:14:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Sinasabi mo bang sinasadya ng isang tao\Nakit ang nasugatang baboy-ramo para saktan siya?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.67,0:14:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi namin malalaman, kahit na iyon ang kaso.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.55,0:14:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Titingnan ko ang mga malapit na CCTV camera at dashcam.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.85,0:14:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Ako mismo ang magsusuri sa kanila.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.35,0:14:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Gusto mo bang gawin iyon?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.89,0:15:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, ihahanda ko sila.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.81,0:15:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Pasensya na...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.35,0:15:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,kinailangan itong mangyari sa iyong pagbisita, Mr. Yoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.07,0:15:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Huwag kang mag-alala tungkol dito, ginoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.28,0:15:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Yoon, subukan mo ang sabaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.03,0:15:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Nahuli ko ang pheasant na iyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.20,0:15:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Halika. Huwag kang magsinungaling, Tatay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.37,0:15:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Binili namin sila sa malapit na farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.21,0:15:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Sige. Tara kain na tayo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.75,0:15:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Kumain ka na.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.26,0:15:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Salamat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.41,0:15:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit mo tinimplahan ang mga ugat ng bellflower?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.87,0:15:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyun-woo prefers them charbroiled.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.87,0:16:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi, gusto ko rin ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.41,0:16:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Talaga?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.50,0:16:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.83,0:16:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Kumain ka na.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.25,0:16:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.05,0:16:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Yoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.13,0:16:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Ito ay mga dahon ng lacquer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.59,0:16:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Bihira lang sila.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.64,0:16:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang mga may lahi sa bundok\N napakasarap at mahirap hanapin.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.64,0:16:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Meron ako noong bata pa ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.14,0:16:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,"Mas bata"?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.27,0:16:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ka ba lumaki sa U.S.?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.65,0:16:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi, nagpunta ako doon noong 13 years old ako\Nold. Nasa Korea ako hanggang noon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.36,0:16:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Dyan ba nag-immigrate ang pamilya mo\Hindi ka rin nag-aaral sa ibang bansa?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.40,0:16:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Ampon ako sa ibang bansa.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.03,0:16:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Pumanaw ang mga adoptive parents ko\Nright before I graduated college,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.08,0:16:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,kaya wala akong pamilya ngayon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.66,0:16:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Nawalan ako ng mga magulang sa 15,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.71,0:16:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,at ako lang ang nakarating dito.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.08,0:16:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ko alam ang family history mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.92,0:16:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Iba ka sa mga kabataan ngayon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.84,0:16:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Sumasang-ayon ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.97,0:16:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Proud ako sayo na parang nanay mo ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.09,0:17:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Huwag mag-atubiling ituring kaming iyong Koreanong pamilya.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.77,0:17:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Pinahahalagahan ko iyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.06,0:17:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Kumain ka na.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.57,0:17:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Halika rito. Oo, dito.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.74,0:17:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Salamat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.61,0:17:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Pungsan dog ba siya?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.74,0:17:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.04,0:17:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Gwapo siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.29,0:17:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi lang siya gwapo,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.91,0:17:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,pero nailigtas niya ang anak ko ilang taon\NNoong nasunog ang bahay namin.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.54,0:17:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- Totoo ba yan?\N- Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.75,0:17:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Nag-iisa sa bahay ang anak ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.25,0:17:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Mamatay sana siya kung hindi siya ginising ng aso ni Nour...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.05,0:17:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,at kinaladkad siya palabas.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.93,0:17:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Siya ay matalino at tapat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.64,0:17:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Payag ka bang ibenta siya?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.35,0:17:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.90,0:17:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.06,0:17:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Pamilya niya.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.54,0:18:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- Bibigyan kita ng $100,000.\N- Sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.42,0:18:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Pero wala man lang siyang pedigree.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.63,0:18:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi iyon mahalaga.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.80,0:18:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Mag-aalok ako ng mas kaunti sa oras.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.68,0:18:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,$90,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.94,0:18:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- $80,000.\N- Teka.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.07,0:18:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.78,0:18:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Ibebenta ko siya,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.07,0:18:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,pero...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.62,0:18:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,maari mo ba kaming bigyan ng $100,000?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.95,0:18:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo naman.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.76,0:19:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.01,0:19:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Isa lang ang wala sa akin.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.48,0:19:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Ito ay prejudice, tama ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.94,0:19:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Ngunit paano ito?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.81,0:19:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Tungkol ito kay Mr. Yoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.27,0:19:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ba siya masyadong mahiyain para sa\Nisang taong napakaraming pinagdaanan sa buhay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.69,0:19:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Siguro nagsikap siya para makabawi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.03,0:19:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Huwag husgahan ang isang libro sa pabalat nito.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.53,0:19:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi mo malalaman kung ano ang iniisip ng isang tao.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.37,0:19:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Sigurado ka bang taga-U.S. ka?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.87,0:19:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas alam mo ang aming wika at\NKorean proverbs kaysa sa akin.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.54,0:19:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Sinabi ko na sa iyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.87,0:19:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Pinasalita lang kami ng tatay ko\NKorean at magbasa ng mga Korean books sa bahay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.79,0:19:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang bait na tao.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.88,0:19:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi lahat ay maaaring maging propesor ng Ivy League.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.30,0:19:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Gusto mo ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.85,0:19:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama. Kahit na ang beer ay masyadong mapait para sa iyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.73,0:19:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Alam mo masama ang pakiramdam ko na hindi pwedeng si\NI ang kainuman mo, di ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.32,0:19:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang ibig mong sabihin? Huwag kang sumama.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.78,0:20:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Kailangan ko ng banyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.46,0:20:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Napakadaldal niya.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.39,0:20:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang kwarto mo ang pinakahuli\Wala sa ikalawang palapag.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.10,0:20:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo, alam ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.02,0:20:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Magkaroon ng magandang gabi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.48,0:20:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Dapat kang umakyat sa itaas.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.78,0:20:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Gagawin ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.11,0:20:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Magandang gabi, kung gayon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.86,0:20:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama, Soo-cheol.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.91,0:20:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Humingi ka sa akin ng payo noong nakaraan...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.99,0:20:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,sa kung paano mapunta sa magandang panig ng mga miyembro ng KFTC...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.79,0:20:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,nung pinatawag ka nila.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.21,0:20:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.50,0:20:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang sasabihin mo?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.71,0:21:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Gusto mo ba ng ilang detalyadong tip ngayon?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.55,0:21:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Ngayon?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.46,0:21:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Batay sa legal na kadalubhasaan na nakuha ko\Nsa aking mga araw ng pag-aaral ng abogasya sa SNU,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.80,0:21:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,at mga taon ng pagtatrabaho sa legal team,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.60,0:21:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Maaari akong mag-alok ng malawak na\Nyet simpleng paliwanag.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.69,0:21:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Libre ako hanggang hating-gabi.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.36,0:21:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ako. Hinihintay ako ng asawa ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.40,0:21:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Talaga? Nakakahiya.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.32,0:21:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Ibig kong sabihin, nakakahiya sa iyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.91,0:21:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Ito ay isang magandang pagkakataon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.16,0:21:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Natatakot ka ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.71,0:21:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Sa ano?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.04,0:21:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Natutulog sa parehong kwarto ni Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.35,0:21:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Soo-cheol.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.48,0:21:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Kalokohan iyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.69,0:22:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Kasal na kami.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.81,0:22:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit ako matatakot na\Nmatulog sa tabi ng asawa ko?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.86,0:22:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Sige.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.28,0:22:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Saan ka pupunta? Doon sa taas ang kwarto mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.29,0:22:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Alam ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.67,0:22:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Diretso.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.92,0:22:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Talagang...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.01,0:22:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,kawawa siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.86,0:22:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- Nasaan ang alak?\N- Ano ang ibig mong sabihin?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.65,0:22:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Ininom mo lahat.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.99,0:22:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Ginawa ko?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.11,0:22:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Lasing ka na ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.07,0:22:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.87,0:22:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- Matulog na tayo.\N- Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.25,0:23:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Ininom ko lahat.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.54,0:23:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang nagtagal sa iyo?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.00,0:23:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ka natutulog?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.34,0:23:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagising ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.84,0:23:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagtanong ako sa iyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.80,0:23:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.43,0:23:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Soo-cheol asked me something,\Nso nag-uusap kami.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.47,0:23:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.27,0:24:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang lokong iyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.68,0:24:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Ginugulo ka ba niya sa oras na ito?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.06,0:24:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Honey. Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.11,0:24:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Huwag masyadong mainitin ang ulo.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.49,0:24:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Dapat ba akong bumalik doon...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.99,0:24:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,at bigyan siya ng mahigpit na babala?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.70,0:24:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay lang yan.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.79,0:24:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama? Yun ang naisip ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.54,0:24:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- Tulungan mo akong tanggalin ang pang-itaas ko.\N- Ano?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.42,0:24:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Na-sprain yata ang mga daliri ko.\NITs hurts to unbutton it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.92,0:24:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaya mo ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.80,0:24:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ako?\N- Oo.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.01,0:24:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- I-unbutton ka?\N- Oo, bumalik dito.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.31,0:24:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Narito.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.99,0:24:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama na.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.58,0:25:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaya ko na ang iba.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.54,0:25:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.67,0:25:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.68,0:25:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit hindi ka naghuhubad?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.09,0:25:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Kailangan ko ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.10,0:25:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ka naliligo?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.31,0:25:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Kailangan ko ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.66,0:25:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ako dapat lumabas?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.80,0:25:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang problema mo?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.47,0:26:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Huwag mo siyang gawing glamorize. Hindi naman siya ganoon kagwapo.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.70,0:26:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Okay ka lang?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.78,0:26:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi. Itigil mo na.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.74,0:26:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Huwag itong i-replay sa slow motion.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.88,0:26:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Huwag gawin ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.09,0:26:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Huwag.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.64,0:26:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ko mahanap...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.52,0:26:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,isang bathrobe.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.53,0:26:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.36,0:27:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakikita ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.29,0:27:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Natulala ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.29,0:27:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Akala ba niya...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.80,0:27:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,sexy siya?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.34,0:28:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Anong nangyari sa katawan niya?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.64,0:28:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Seryoso.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.07,0:28:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano? ano gusto mo
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.12,0:28:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.79,0:28:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Maraming tubig sa sahig.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.33,0:28:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi mo gusto iyon, kaya pupunasan ko na sana.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.38,0:28:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay lang.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.09,0:28:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Tuyuin mo lang ang iyong buhok.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.22,0:28:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Huwag sabihin sa akin...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.26,0:28:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,hindi mo pinatuyo ang iyong buhok...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.43,0:28:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,kasi tumingin ka sa salamin...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.60,0:28:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,at naisip na kamukha mo...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.31,0:28:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,isang basang-basang Timothée Chalamet\Ni isang batang Leonardo DiCaprio.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.48,0:29:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang ibig mong sabihin?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.28,0:29:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Kung hindi iyon ang dahilan,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.86,0:29:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,pagkatapos ay patuyuin ang iyong buhok.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.78,0:29:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.49,0:29:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Gagawin ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.17,0:29:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi kapani-paniwala.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.59,0:29:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Sinabukan niya ba akong akitin?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.55,0:29:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm too stimulated...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.80,0:29:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,para sa oras na ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.62,0:29:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Natutulog ka ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.04,0:29:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi pa.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.17,0:30:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Maliit ang kama.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.46,0:30:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Queen-sized ba ito?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.92,0:30:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Ito ay hari.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.43,0:30:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Napakaliit sa pakiramdam...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.39,0:30:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,para maging king-size.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.68,0:30:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,May oras...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.60,0:30:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,nung magkatabi kami...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.98,0:30:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,sa single bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.31,0:30:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Kailan?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.57,0:30:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi mo ba naaalala?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.74,0:30:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang una kong pagbisita sa Yongdu-ri.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.53,0:30:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Certificate of Award\NDiligence Award{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.39,0:30:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Magpalipas ng gabi dito.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.32,0:31:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Huli na.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.83,0:31:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Ito ay 9 p.m.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.41,0:31:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Medyo huli na.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.16,0:31:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}- Delikado magmaneho sa gabi.\N- Totoo iyon.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.17,0:31:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Tama.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.96,0:31:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Dito ka matulog.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.13,0:31:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Pupunta ako sa kwartong iyon.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.05,0:31:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Pupunta ako diyan...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.64,0:31:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}kung kailangan mo ako.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.27,0:31:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Magandang gabi, kung gayon.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.78,0:32:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Mukhang maganda ang buwan.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.53,0:32:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Siguro maaari nating tingnan ito nang magkasama.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.16,0:32:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Pumasok...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.17,0:32:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}kung gusto mo.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.28,0:33:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oo nga pala...\N- Oo?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.28,0:33:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Paano kami nakatulog...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.41,0:33:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,sa kama na iyon?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.25,0:33:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagyakapan kami.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.42,0:33:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.04,0:33:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagyakapan ba tayo?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.05,0:33:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Gusto mo bang yumakap kung masyadong maliit ang kama?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.39,0:33:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay lang ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.47,0:33:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ito masyadong maliit.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.39,0:33:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,May kwarto ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.40,0:33:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- Talaga?\N- Oo.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.23,0:33:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Pagkatapos...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.90,0:33:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,gusto mo bang yakapin...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.24,0:33:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,gayunpaman?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.42,0:34:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagbibiro lang ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.88,0:34:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Huwag kang matakot.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.60,0:35:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Anong ginagawa mo dito?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.23,0:35:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Kabutihan.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.39,0:35:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Pasensya na.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.10,0:35:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Wala ako sa tamang pag-iisip kahapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.23,0:35:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Gusto kong ibalik ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.48,0:35:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Pakiusap tulungan kami. Hindi kami makatulog kagabi.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.91,0:35:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Niregalo ko na yung aso\Nto sa kanya, kaya hindi ko magawa yun.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.91,0:35:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Pasensya na.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.66,0:35:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Pamilya na siya sa amin, dahil nailigtas niya ang anak namin.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.50,0:35:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Siguro nabaliw ako sa pagbebenta sa kanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.38,0:35:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Sige. Kukunin ko ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.92,0:35:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- Salamat.\N- Salamat.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.88,0:35:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Maraming salamat, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.88,0:35:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Kabutihan.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.05,0:35:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Anong ginagawa mo?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.93,0:35:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakonsensya ka sa pagbebenta sa kanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.26,0:35:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaya patayin na lang natin siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.43,0:35:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas maganda ba iyon?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.27,0:35:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Anong ginagawa mo?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.70,0:36:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Sus, muntik na naman kitang mabaril.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.62,0:36:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagtanong ako sa iyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.87,0:36:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagbibiro lang ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.13,0:36:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Joke ba iyon sa iyo?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.71,0:36:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano sa tingin mo iyon?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.72,0:36:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Ibinalik mo ba ang pera?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.97,0:36:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakuha mo ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.18,0:36:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Saksi mo ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.22,0:36:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Natapos na ang deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.69,0:36:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Maaari kang pumunta.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.28,0:36:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Salamat.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.24,0:36:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Salamat. Tara na.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.65,0:36:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- Bilisan mo.\N- Oo nga pala,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.66,0:36:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,bakit hindi ko ito mapatay?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.53,0:36:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Narinig mo siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.91,0:36:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Na-dote siya sa aso.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.66,0:36:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang aso ay parang pamilya.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.21,0:36:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Kung ganoon, okay lang bang\Npumatay ng inabandona o ligaw na aso?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.36,0:37:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Iyan ang pasukan sa kagubatan.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.74,0:37:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Walang ibang pumasok maliban sa pamilya namin.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.53,0:37:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Ibig sabihin ba nito ay inside job?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.37,0:37:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Maghintay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.88,0:37:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Tumigil ka diyan.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.80,0:37:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Sino yun?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.89,0:37:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Likod niya lang ang nakikita ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.43,0:37:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Kapatid mo yan.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.02,0:37:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi pwede iyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.06,0:37:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.40,0:38:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi namin alam kung sigurado.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.61,0:38:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi gagawin iyon ni Beom-seok.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.90,0:38:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Alamin kung nasa Korea pa siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.24,0:38:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.40,0:38:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Mag-pack up.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.70,0:38:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- Na?\N- Nasira ang araw.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.28,0:38:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Uwi na tayo.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.70,0:38:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- Mahal, naaalala mo ba ang batang iyon?\N- Ano?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.91,0:38:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Nangyari ito mahigit dalawang dekada na ang nakalipas.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.67,0:38:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Iyong insidente kung saan namatay ang German\NShepherd ng isang brewery,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.21,0:38:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,at ang pumatay ay bata pala.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.19,0:38:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama, yung mula sa\NEvergreen Hope Orphanage.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.01,0:38:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakatanggap siya ng scholarship mula sa\NQueens Group dahil napakatalino niya.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.89,0:38:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Ilang beses ko siyang pinakain noong bumisita siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.43,0:38:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oo, siya.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.52,0:38:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Naaalala mo ba ang sinabi niya sa pulis?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.44,0:38:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Ikaw ito, di ba?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.40,0:38:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Bakit mo papatayin ang mahalagang aso ng isang tao?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.86,0:38:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Hindi ko ito papalampasin.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.57,0:38:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Alam mo ba kung magkano ang halaga niya?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.24,0:38:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Pasensya na.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.78,0:38:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Humihingi ng paumanhin sa kanya sa sandaling ito.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.49,0:38:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Ano ang pinagkaiba ng isang mahalagang aso?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.17,0:39:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Kung gayon, okay lang bang pumatay...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.67,0:39:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}isang normal na aso?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.09,0:39:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Ano ang problema ng batang iyon?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.09,0:39:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Sus, ano ang sinasabi niya?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.47,0:39:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sus, tama ka.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.76,0:39:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Tinanong nga niya ang tanong na iyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.89,0:39:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakakatakot marinig ang sinabi ng isang batang lalaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.26,0:39:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- Diba kamukha niya?\N- Sino?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.35,0:40:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Hoy, ako ito. Nakauwi ka ba ng ligtas?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.02,0:40:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Na-book kita ng meeting kay Mr. Hermann.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.94,0:40:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Seryoso ka ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.40,0:40:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Salamat.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.57,0:40:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, see you then.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.61,0:40:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ka mabibigo.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.50,0:40:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Lahat ng Mail{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.31,0:40:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Humihingi kami ng paumanhin...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.36,0:40:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Pupunta ako...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.11,0:40:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,na mamatay?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.20,0:40:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Kapag malapit na si Hercyna?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.70,0:40:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Kapag ganito ako kalapit sa One Billion Club?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.33,0:41:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Imposible.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.37,0:41:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Marami akong limited-edition\NI na hindi pa nasusuot.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.83,0:41:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakabili ako ng napakaraming isla,\Npero hindi ko pa sila binibisita.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.17,0:41:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,At mamamatay pa rin ako?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.05,0:41:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi, magiging sayang iyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.10,0:41:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Binili ko lahat ng ito sa mga artista...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.93,0:41:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,sa kanilang 90s, dahil\Nposthumous works skyrocket,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.44,0:41:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,so paano ako mamamatay sa harap nila?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.78,0:41:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Sayang iyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.92,0:41:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Ikaw ang pinakamalaking basura.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.39,0:42:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Kung gayon, tapusin na natin ang kontrata ng tindahang ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.31,0:42:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Magandang trabaho, lahat.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.29,0:43:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- Secretary Na.\N- Yes, ma'am?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.88,0:43:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,May mga babae ba na ang puso ay\Nrace pa rin kapag nakikita nila ang kanilang asawa,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.59,0:43:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,sa kabila ng mahigit tatlong taon nang kasal?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.80,0:43:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit ang bilis ng tibok ng puso nila?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.97,0:43:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- May arrhythmia ba sila?\N- Hindi, hindi iyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.35,0:43:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Siguro...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.02,0:43:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,dahil...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.81,0:43:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,gwapo sila?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.48,0:43:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ang mga asawa nila?\N- Oo.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.81,0:43:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Baka may sakit siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.65,0:43:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,May kilala ka bang ganyan?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.07,0:43:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo, ginagawa ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.36,0:43:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Sa ilang araw, tinitingnan siya nito sa mata...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.54,0:43:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,at gustong yakapin siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.58,0:43:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.67,0:43:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Dahil naaawa siya sa kanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.79,0:43:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Masama ang pakiramdam niya...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.84,0:44:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,na ang isang malambot na kaluluwa ay\Nto tiisin ang malupit na mundong ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.59,0:44:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hindi.\N- Sa ibang mga araw,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.76,0:44:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,mukhang balikat niya...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.89,0:44:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,napakalawak.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.72,0:44:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Gusto niyang hawakan siya nito.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.43,0:44:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Para siyang naglalakad, seksing dinamita.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.48,0:44:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Nag-iisip siya kung dapat ba niyang hayaan ang {\i1}homme fatal...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.36,0:44:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,malayang gumala sa mundong ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.44,0:44:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Pakisabi sa kanya na magpatingin sa doktor. May sakit siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.70,0:44:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sa tingin mo ba?\N- Sinasabi ko sayo.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.49,0:44:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Siguraduhin na magpapa-brain CT scan siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.45,0:44:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,May malubhang problema sa itaas.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.33,0:44:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Secretary Na.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.71,0:44:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Magaling ka.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.96,0:44:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- Naging kakaiba ako nitong mga araw na ito.\N- Paano?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.76,0:44:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakikiramay ako...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.09,0:44:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,para sa iba.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.14,0:44:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- Kakaiba ba iyon?\N- Hindi ako naging ganito.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.22,0:44:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Malamig ang loob ko,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.10,0:44:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,kaya kakaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.90,0:44:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Napakaingay mo.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.40,0:45:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Huwag ka nang umiyak kapag isinakripisyo ko ang braso ko para sa iyo.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.53,0:45:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,At patuloy akong nakikiramay...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.49,0:45:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,kasama ang iba.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.71,0:45:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Ano iyon?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.71,0:45:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Hindi pinapayagan ang mga Solicitor dito.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.55,0:45:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Pasensya na. Asawa siya ng kakilala ko.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.68,0:45:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}So pinapaboran mo siya?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.55,0:45:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Nasa incubator ang kanilang sanggol.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.26,0:45:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Masama ang pakiramdam ko, kaya...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.35,0:45:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Hindi na siya babalik.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.35,0:45:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}- Sorry.\N- Gaano katagal ang baby...?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.56,0:45:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Paumanhin?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.89,0:45:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}...kailangang nandoon?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.94,0:45:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}- Mga tatlo...\N- Kalimutan mo na. Isang linggo? Dalawa?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.36,0:45:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Hahayaan ko lang siyang dumaan.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.03,0:45:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Papayag ka bang gawin niya iyon?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.20,0:45:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Mas mabuting hindi ko na siya makita\Nonce na discharged na ang kanyang baby.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.91,0:45:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Walang insurance ang sasagot dito.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.20,0:45:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Gusto kong gamitin ang aming security\Ndeposit para sa kanyang operasyon,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.58,0:45:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}pero ayaw makinig ng nanay ko.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.96,0:45:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Sabi niya pera ko para sa kasal.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.00,0:46:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Pera ang palaging problema.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.46,0:46:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Pasensya na.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.06,0:46:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Hindi kapani-paniwala.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.35,0:46:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Hindi lang ang nanay niya ang may sakit.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.56,0:46:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Mapapagamot ang nanay niya,\Nso bakit siya iiyak...?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.70,0:46:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Bakit ang daming may sakit?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.62,0:46:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Nakakainis.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.33,0:46:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ako naging ganito.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.00,0:46:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Wala akong pakialam...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.04,0:46:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,tungkol sa sakit ng mga tao, kaya bakit ako ganito?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.13,0:46:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Pinapabilis ng asawa ko ang puso ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.38,0:46:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Naniniwala akong hindi gumagana ng maayos ang utak ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.64,0:46:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,, Ito ba ang mga sintomas ng aking sakit?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.60,0:46:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi talaga.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.22,0:47:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Maraming pasyenteng may terminally-ill\Nakararanas ng mga pagbabago sa puso.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.02,0:47:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Napagtanto nila ang mga bagay na hindi nila napagtanto...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.27,0:47:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,kung hindi sila namamatay.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.57,0:47:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,"Nagbabago ka dahil sa kamatayan."
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.53,0:47:08.96,Default,,0,0,0, "Malapit ka nang mamatay."
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.99,0:47:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I think that's what you're insinuating,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.41,0:47:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,pero nagkakamali ka.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.91,0:47:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakikita mo, maraming beses na akong nasa bingit ng kamatayan,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.99,0:47:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,at ang aking mahimalang suwerte...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.29,0:47:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,iniligtas ako sa bawat pagkakataon.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.30,0:47:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Kung hindi ka sapat para iligtas ako,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.01,0:47:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,tapos manood ka lang.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.72,0:47:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Isa pang himala...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.06,0:47:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,ay magliligtas sa akin.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.27,0:47:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hoy, Hyun-woo.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.82,0:47:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Matagal na.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.24,0:47:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo, pumunta ako sa hunting ground! Kaya ano?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.06,0:47:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit mo ginawa?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.12,0:47:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Upang makita si Ama. Nandiyan siya\Naround this time of the year.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.16,0:47:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Pero umalis ka ng hindi mo siya nakikita.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.25,0:48:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Ikaw ba...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.54,0:48:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,hinala ako?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.58,0:48:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Nabuksan ang bakod\Nand may pain sa malapit.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.13,0:48:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Pagkatapos ay inatake ng baboy-ramo na binaril si Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.63,0:48:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- May sinasadya...\N- So?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.68,0:48:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Muntik nang mamatay ang anak ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.43,0:48:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Sabihin mo sa akin ang totoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.81,0:48:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Ito ang iyong huling babala.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.06,0:48:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakakainis ka kasi kasali si Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.65,0:48:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit hindi ka nagalit noong ako ay\Nmaling inakusahan at pinalayas?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.32,0:48:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, umupo ka.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.07,0:48:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Pumunta ako doon dahil alam kong\Nit ang araw ng pangangaso ng pamilya,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.91,0:48:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,pero pagpunta ko doon,\Nsabi ng dakilang Moh Seul-hee...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.42,0:48:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,natutulog siya at hindi niya ako hinayaang makita.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.63,0:48:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakiusap ako sa kanya, ngunit walang epekto,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.13,0:48:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,kaya bumalik ako. Iyon lang.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.47,0:48:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.09,0:48:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Beom-jun.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.76,0:48:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Tulungan mo akong makilala siya kahit isang beses lang.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.39,0:49:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Iyon lang ang kailangan ko. Gusto kong\NMakipagkasundo bago maging huli ang lahat.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.10,0:49:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Minsan...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.60,0:49:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,mas mabuting bitawan.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.79,0:49:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyun-woo.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.75,0:49:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ba kakaiba ang pamilya ko?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.63,0:49:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Paumanhin? Hindi naman, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.71,0:49:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayroon kaming pitong demanda laban sa isa't isa.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.47,0:49:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Dapat nakalakad ka sa\Neggshells habang nag-aalaga ka...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.55,0:49:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,ng ating mga walang kuwentang bagay.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.31,0:49:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Napakarami mong nagawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.86,0:49:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Kumusta.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.99,0:50:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Tulog na ang chairman.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.24,0:50:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Na?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.87,0:50:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Gisingin ko ba siya?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.41,0:50:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay lang yan.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.54,0:50:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,dumaan lang ako para batiin siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.58,0:50:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Paalam, kung gayon.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.59,0:50:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Ms. Moh.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.84,0:50:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Pumunta ba si Beom-seok sa aming hunting ground...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.85,0:50:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,at humiling na makita si Ama?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.31,0:50:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi, hindi niya ginawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.98,0:50:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Iyan ba ang sinabi niya?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.61,0:50:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Tingnan mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.48,0:50:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Ayoko na sabihin ito,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.15,0:50:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,pero mag-ingat ka sa kanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.57,0:50:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagtitimpi siya sa\Na habang matapos ma-kick out.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.28,0:50:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang mga walang talo ang pinakanakakatakot.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.13,0:50:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Anong klaseng tao si\NMr. Yoon Eun-sung? alam mo ba
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.30,0:50:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Yoon?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.51,0:51:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Alam ko ang business side niya,\Npero hindi siya bilang tao.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.89,0:51:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Alam mo ang mga taong tulad natin\Nhindi dapat madaling magtiwala sa iba.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.64,0:51:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Kung mawawala rin ang deal na ito,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.60,0:51:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Iiwan ni Tatay si Soo-cheol.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.40,0:51:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Huwag mag-alala.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.48,0:51:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Titingnan ko siya nang maingat.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.02,0:51:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hinahanap mo ako?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.23,0:51:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Sus, ginulat mo ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.70,0:52:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Isang background check?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.83,0:52:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Medyo maingat siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.29,0:52:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Natatakot lang siya,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.66,0:52:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,pero sa simula pa lang.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.08,0:52:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Madaling magtiwala ang mga taong tulad niya\Nonce they let down their guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.34,0:52:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Medyo binitawan niya ang kanyang bantay.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.67,0:52:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Nga pala, may nakikita ka bang pag-asa kay Hae-in?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.43,0:52:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Mahalaga sa akin ang pera,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.10,0:52:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,pero gusto ko ring makitang maghiwalay ang mag-asawang iyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.39,0:52:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.39,0:52:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Ligtas na sabihin na ako ang nagpasimuno sa\Nmatchmaking scene sa bansang ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.86,0:52:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Gayunpaman, nabigo akong maayos\Nikasal ang anak ni Queens.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.69,0:52:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Gaano kahiya iyon?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.49,0:52:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Paghiwalayin ko sila sa lahat ng bagay,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.78,0:52:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,at kunin ang nawala kong karangalan at pagganap.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.70,0:52:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Kung ganoon, huwag mo nang ulitin ang ginawa mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.50,0:52:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- Makakagambala ka.\N- Iyon ay...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.71,0:52:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Sinabi sa akin na gawin iyon,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.25,0:53:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,pero pumasok si Hyun-woo, pinatay ang baboy-ramo,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.17,0:53:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,at na-save si Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.26,0:53:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ko nakitang darating iyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.80,0:53:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hyun-woo, nag-level up ka na.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.76,0:53:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Mula kay Mr. Cinderella na\Nkasal sa isang mayamang pamilya,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.14,0:53:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,sa isang lifesaver na nagligtas sa buhay ng kanilang anak na babae!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.98,0:53:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Iba na ang pakikitungo nila sa akin ngayon.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.98,0:53:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,First time kong kumain ng pheasant leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.48,0:53:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Karaniwan akong binibigyan ng leeg o ang mga lean cut,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.24,0:53:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,pero binigay sa akin ng biyenan ko ang binti.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.41,0:53:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Masyado pang maaga para maging kampante.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.04,0:53:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Ipagpatuloy ang mabuting gawain.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.37,0:53:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Paano?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.46,0:53:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,"Ginagawa ko lang ang trabaho ko."
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.42,0:53:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Huwag sirain ang pagkakataong ito\Nsa pagsasalita ng kalokohan.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.42,0:53:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,"Oo, natakot din ako. Pwedeng\Ndiyan ako, pero ginawa ko para kay Hae-in."
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.01,0:53:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Kailangan mong kumuha ng credit.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.64,0:53:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- Kailangan ko ba?\N- Oo, kailangan mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.18,0:53:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang pagkuha ng credit ay parang pangongolekta ng mga kupon ng kape.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.06,0:53:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Kailangan mong mangolekta ng sampung kupon...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.44,0:54:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,para malaman nila na ikaw ay\Nregular at bigyan ka ng mga freebies.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.44,0:54:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ko kailangan...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.32,0:54:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,anumang freebies.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.40,0:54:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang gusto ko lang ay maging malaya at hindi nasaktan.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.28,0:54:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang tanga.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.16,0:54:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Magpaalam ka kung pupunta ka...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.74,0:54:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- para maging peke.\N- Paalam sa ano?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.12,0:54:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,"Paalam, aking Italian suit."
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.96,0:54:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,"Paalam, ang aking handmade designer na sapatos."
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.83,0:54:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,"Paalam, aking dayuhang sasakyan."
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.08,0:54:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,"Paalam, ang marangyang relo sa aking pulso."
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.50,0:54:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,"Paalam, ang swerte ni Hae-in."
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.13,0:54:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Babalik na ngayon si Cinderella\Nsa kanyang taniman sa timog,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.01,0:54:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,pero ang problema, hindi siya malugod na tatanggapin ng kanyang pamilya\N.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.14,0:54:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Pasensya na, Coach.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.98,0:54:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi interesado ang anak ko sa boxing\Nand ay gustong mag-Taekwondo sa halip.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.57,0:54:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay lang yan. Ganyan ang mga bata.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.53,0:54:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Paalam, kung gayon.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.74,0:54:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Tara na.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.91,0:54:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Nga pala, Jae-hyeon,\Nbakit gusto mo ang Taekwondo?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.24,0:54:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,May mga sinturon sila.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.62,0:54:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Sinturon? Para sa baywang mo?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.16,0:54:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaya ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.91,0:55:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaya gusto niyang pumunta.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.46,0:55:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Jae-hyeon, may mga sinturon din kami.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.17,0:55:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Tingnan mo 'yan.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.30,0:55:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Ito ang champion belt.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.59,0:55:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Coach, okay lang.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.18,0:55:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ta-da.\N- Gosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.43,0:55:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Tingnan ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.51,0:55:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang masasabi mo? Hindi ba't mas maganda kaysa sa mga sinturong iyon?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.81,0:55:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Sila rin ang nagwawasak ng mga bagay.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.10,0:55:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Smash?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.56,0:55:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Nasisira din namin ang mga bagay.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.90,0:55:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Wala lang kaming oras. Dapat ko bang ipakita sa iyo?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.65,0:55:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi, hindi mo na kailangang ipakita sa kanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.28,0:55:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Maghintay.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.28,0:55:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Bigyan mo ako ng isang segundo.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.65,0:55:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Nasaan ang board?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.95,0:55:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Ayan na.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.87,0:55:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. Tingnan mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.95,0:55:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Tingnan ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.00,0:55:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Ganito ang gagawin mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.59,0:55:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Babagsakin ko ito sa pagkakataong ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.30,0:55:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Panoorin mo ako.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.68,0:55:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Sus!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.35,0:56:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,See? Nabasag ko ito, tama ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.44,0:56:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- Astig din ang boxing?\N- Pero...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.81,0:56:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano? Ano ito sa oras na ito?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.48,0:56:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Gusto kong mag-Taekwondo dahil si Ji-seong ang gumagawa nito.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.15,0:56:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Si Ji-seong ang matalik niyang kaibigan.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.57,0:56:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.87,0:56:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Sinasabi ko lang ito kasi\NI care a lot about Jae-hyeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.79,0:56:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi mo ba naisip na dapat siyang magkaroon ng iba't ibang kaibigan?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.98,0:56:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Paumanhin?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.04,0:56:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- Kilala mo ba si Baek Ho-yeol?\N- I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.84,0:56:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Anak ko siya, at katulad mo siya.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.38,0:56:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Mahilig siya sa mga laro, tulad mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.51,0:56:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang sarap pumunta dito para magbox...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.35,0:56:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,at makipaglaro sa kanya pagkatapos ng klase?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.23,0:56:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Si Ho-yeol ang may pinakamababang grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.81,0:56:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.11,0:56:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Coach.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.73,0:56:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagdudugo ka.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.11,0:56:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Sus.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.74,0:56:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit ako...?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.37,0:56:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sus, huwag kang mag-alala sa akin.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.41,0:56:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Tiyak na nasimot ako ng kahoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.24,0:57:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Paalam, kung gayon.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.79,0:57:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Aalis ka na ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.87,0:57:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- Tara na.\N- Umuwi ng ligtas, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.96,0:57:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Paalam.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.38,0:57:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.58,0:57:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Jae-hyeon, see you again!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.25,0:57:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.34,0:57:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Paalam, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.86,0:57:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hoy, dinudugo ka.\N- Isang scrape lang.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.82,0:57:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Kinuha ako ng kahoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.19,0:57:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit ka ba naiirita?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.07,0:57:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ako masyadong natutulog kani-kanina lang,\Nkaya isinara ko ang aking salon ngayon.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.87,0:57:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Dapat kong isara ang gym na ito sa lalong madaling panahon,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.70,0:57:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,at isaalang-alang ang pagtatrabaho sa ilalim ng\Nisang tao kapag nagdiborsyo si Hyun-woo.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.25,0:57:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Itigil ang pag-uusap tungkol sa kanyang diborsyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.96,0:57:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Dapat kong tanggapin ang realidad at ihanda ang sarili ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.00,0:57:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- Dapat ba tayong pumunta sa Seoul?\N- At ano ang gagawin?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.01,0:57:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Tinawagan ko si Hae-in, pero hindi niya sinasagot.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.30,0:57:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Kilalanin natin siya nang personal at\Ndissuade siya na makipagdivorce.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.18,0:57:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- Humanda ka.\N- Ano?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.64,0:58:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Tara na.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.97,0:58:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Labis kang tutol sa buong planong ito,\Npero sa bandang huli ay nakapasok ka.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.06,0:58:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.15,0:58:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Lagi kong ginagawa ang lahat ng aking makakaya kapag\NI ay naglalagay ng aking isip sa isang bagay.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.57,0:58:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama ka.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.65,0:58:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Lagi mong ginagawa ang mga bagay nang buong puso,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.57,0:58:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,pero eto ang problema.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.11,0:58:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Lokohin mo siya nang buong puso, at magiging maayos ang lahat,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.91,0:58:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,ngunit gumawa ng isang mahusay na trabaho,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.79,0:58:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,at magagalit siya kapag nalaman niya ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.42,0:58:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- Malamang, diba?\N- Tama,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.75,0:58:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,kaya hindi ka dapat mahuli. Nakuha na?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.80,0:58:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ako mahuhuli,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.13,0:58:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,basta tayo...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.14,0:58:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,, panatilihin itong sikreto.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.51,0:58:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.35,0:58:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, diba dapat nating sabihin\NHyun-woo na magkikita kami ni Hae-in?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.65,0:58:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang tanga mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.73,0:58:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sa tingin mo papayag ba siya?\NWala tayong mawawala ngayon.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.48,0:58:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Dapat nating subukang pigilan sila sa lahat ng paraan, tama ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.45,0:58:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Tapak dito.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.04,0:59:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Ongoing Recruitment{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.43,0:59:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang dapat nating sabihin sa kanila?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.89,0:59:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi namin kailangang magpakilala.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.27,0:59:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ka ba nanonood ng mga drama?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.14,0:59:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang opisina ng secretary ang namamahala sa mga VIP na pamilya.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.19,0:59:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Magugulat sila sa sandaling makita nila ang aming mga mukha at sasabihing,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.78,0:59:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,"Ms. Hong, nandito ang hipag mo."
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.03,0:59:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Pagkatapos ay papasukin nila kami kaagad.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.95,0:59:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Kailangan mong mag-book ng appointment.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.41,0:59:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Bago ka lang dito.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.01,0:59:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Tingnan mo ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.22,1:00:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Ako iyon.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.59,1:00:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Itong wavy-haired guy ay siya.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.14,1:00:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay? Tayo yun. Kita mo?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.64,1:00:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Iwan ang iyong pangalan at numero,\Nand ibibigay ko ito sa kanya.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.73,1:00:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Tingnan.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.65,1:00:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Kami ang pamilya niya. Kami ay bahagi ng maharlikang pamilya.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.73,1:00:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit kailangan nating mag-book ng\Nappointment para makita ang ating pamilya?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.69,1:00:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Sus.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.99,1:00:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Mangyaring mag-book ng appointment at bumalik...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.91,1:00:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.04,1:00:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Matagal na.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.96,1:00:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Ako si Hyeon-tae, kapatid ni Hyun-woo.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.75,1:00:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Alam ko.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.50,1:00:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Inisip ko kung ikaw iyon, at tama ako.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.09,1:00:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Kailangan nating mag-usap. Kahit si Hyun-woo\Ndi alam na nandito kami.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.84,1:00:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.26,1:00:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Aakyat na ba tayo?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.85,1:00:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Sige.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.44,1:00:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sa ganitong paraan.\N- Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.94,1:01:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagulat ka ba?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.24,1:01:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Pero nakikita mo, hindi namin paparusahan\Nyou sa hindi pagkilala sa amin.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.78,1:01:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Huwag mag-alala.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.87,1:01:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi namin inaabuso ang aming kapangyarihan sa ganoong paraan.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.76,1:01:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Ikaw ay abala.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.93,1:01:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Paumanhin dumating kami nang hindi ipinaalam.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.39,1:01:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Ilang beses na talaga akong tumawag,\Npero hindi kita makontak.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.14,1:01:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ako kumukuha ng mga hindi naka-save na numero.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.89,1:01:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Wala kang number ko.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.35,1:01:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang nagdadala sa iyo dito?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.81,1:01:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakikita mo...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.19,1:01:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Saan ako magsisimula?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.53,1:01:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Ito ay ika-60 na kaarawan ng aming ama kamakailan.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.87,1:01:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Dapat nandito ka kasi\Ngagalit ka na hindi ako sumipot.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.40,1:01:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Sus, hindi naman.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.45,1:01:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.47,1:01:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Siyempre hindi, dahil hindi naman kami nagalit.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.00,1:02:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ko alam kung ano ang mararamdaman mo dito,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.01,1:02:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,pero si Hyun-woo...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.43,1:02:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oo?\N- Mahirap siya di ba?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.76,1:02:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sorry?\N- Sus, naiintindihan ko.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.05,1:02:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Intindihin kung ano?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.14,1:02:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang taong polar opposite ng\Nyou ay wala sa kabilang panig ng globo.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.02,1:02:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Ito ang taong pinakasalan mo,\Nyung katabi mong matulog at kumain.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.19,1:02:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ka nila lubos na naiintindihan.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.09,1:02:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.15,1:02:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagtalo kami ng asawa ko\Nang lahat dahil sa AC.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.95,1:02:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Bubuksan niya ang AC sa\Ntag-araw, at nilalamig ako.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.74,1:02:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagmura pa kami sa isa't isa dahil dito.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.83,1:02:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hehead-over-heels siya dati\Nsa akin nung kinasal kami,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.75,1:02:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,ngunit hindi man lang niya mapatay ang AC para sa akin.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.96,1:02:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi kami nagtatalo sa mga ganyang bagay.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.96,1:02:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Totoo ba iyon?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.80,1:02:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Kung gayon ay mahusay.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.18,1:02:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Maganda ang relasyon niyo.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.72,1:02:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Natutulog kami sa magkahiwalay na kwarto,\Nkaya may AC kami.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.39,1:02:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Naiintindihan naman kung\Marami kang ekstrang kwarto.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.85,1:03:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, ito ang lagi kong sinasabi sa kanya.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.15,1:03:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,"Ngayong kasal ka na,\Hindi ka na isa sa amin."
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.52,1:03:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,"Isaalang-alang ang iyong sarili na bahagi ng Queens,\Nand manatili doon kahit na pagkatapos mong mamatay."
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.03,1:03:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,, "Huwag kang maglakas-loob na bumalik\Ni tumuntong sa aming bahay."
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.95,1:03:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,So speaking of which...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.67,1:03:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Div...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.71,1:03:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Pasensya na sa pag-abala,\Npero mahuhuli ka...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.34,1:03:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,para sa iyong pakikipagkita kay Mr. Hermann.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.47,1:03:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Pasensya na, pero kailangan ko nang umalis.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.26,1:03:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,May importante akong hapunan ngayon.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.01,1:03:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, dapat kang pumunta.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.72,1:03:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Ite-text ko sa iyo ang natitirang pag-uusap,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.43,1:03:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,kaya paki-save ang aking numero.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.57,1:03:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- Bibisitahin kita minsan.\N- Talaga? Gagawin mo ba yun?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.70,1:03:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Aaminin ko malayo na tayo\Nung ikasal si Hyun-woo.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.12,1:03:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Tapos, binigyan mo kami ng gusali.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.54,1:03:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Isang gusali?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.54,1:04:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo, yung sa bayan namin.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.62,1:04:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Bumili ba ako ng gusali doon?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.25,1:04:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo, ginawa mo. Sinabi mo sa akin na\Ngget one kapag nagpakasal ka.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.09,1:04:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Ginagamit mo ba yan?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.17,1:04:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.22,1:04:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,ngunit huwag mag-alala.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.64,1:04:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Ako ang naglilinis at nagkukumpuni.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.72,1:04:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Ginagawa ko ang lahat.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.93,1:04:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Huwag mag-alala tungkol sa gusali,\Ndahil nasa ilalim ko ito.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.40,1:04:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Nga pala, bakit bumisita ang mga biyenan mo?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.44,1:04:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ako sigurado.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.15,1:04:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Nabanggit niya kung paano ko hindi\Nattend ang ika-60 ng kanyang ama.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.86,1:04:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,So pumunta siya sa nitpick?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.57,1:04:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Sinabi niya na hindi.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.70,1:04:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Kung gayon?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.37,1:04:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Sabi niya ang kasal ay parang\Non-on ang AC sa summer.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.37,1:04:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano? Ano ang ibig sabihin nito?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.13,1:04:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ka sumasang-ayon sa temperatura.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.67,1:04:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Iyan ay may katuturan.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.23,1:05:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.94,1:05:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- Nasaan si Mr. Hermann?\N- Tama.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.77,1:05:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Pinuntahan niya ang kanyang baby\Ndaughter dahil tumalikod ito.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.15,1:05:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Tinanggal niya ang meeting na ito\Ndahil nabaligtad ang kanyang anak?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.78,1:05:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Family guy siya.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.07,1:05:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Iyon siguro ang dahilan kung bakit siya naghiwalay\Napat na beses at nagkaanak sa edad na 60.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.37,1:05:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakakairita.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.20,1:05:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Dala ko pa yung floor plan,\Nsince gusto niya muna makita.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.20,1:05:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas maganda talaga ito.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.04,1:05:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, may picture na siya sa isip.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.63,1:05:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Alam na nang maaga\Nay magbibigay sa iyo ng bentahe.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.63,1:05:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang gusto niya?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.30,1:05:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano? Bumalik ka na?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.18,1:05:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Akala ko umuwi ka na.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.05,1:05:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Marami pa akong dokumentong titingnan.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.68,1:05:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- Pwede ka nang umuwi.\N- Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.27,1:05:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sinabi nga pala sa akin ni Secretary Na kanina...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.23,1:05:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,na may dinner appointment si Ms. Hong.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.86,1:05:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Sinabi niya na nakikipagpulong si Ms. Hong kay Mr. Yoon Eun-sung,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.78,1:05:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,at maaaring late na umuwi, kaya sir,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.49,1:05:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Sa tingin ko ay ligtas kang umuwi sa halip na manatili dito.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.16,1:06:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Sino ang muli niyang kakilala?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.99,1:06:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Gusto ni Hercyna ng dalawang palapag.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.71,1:06:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- Dalawang palapag?\N- Oo.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.00,1:06:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Kailangan mo ng magarbong hagdanan dito.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.50,1:06:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Paano natin magagawa iyon?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.13,1:06:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ito isang simpleng pagsasaayos.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.09,1:06:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Kailangan kong baguhin ang\NIstruktura at maaprubahan ito.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.80,1:06:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Eksakto. Siya ang magmumungkahi na iyon\Nand piliin kung sino ang mauunang makatapos.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.51,1:06:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakakabaliw iyan.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.97,1:06:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakakatawa...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.64,1:06:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,pero ako lang ang nakakaalam nito?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.73,1:06:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.78,1:06:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, narinig mo ba ang tungkol sa iyong mga kapatid\N bumisita kay Ms. Hong kanina?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.95,1:06:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sino?\N- Ate at kuya mo.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.79,1:06:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Kakasabi lang sa akin ni Secretary Na.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.04,1:06:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi mo ba alam?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.01,1:07:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Kumain bago sila maging basa.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.97,1:07:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Maghintay. "Alam kong mahirap. Tuldok, tuldok, tuldok."
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.85,1:07:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,"Pero hindi ka pa rin makakapag-divorce."
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.27,1:07:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,"Maaari mo bang muling isaalang-alang ito para sa akin?"
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.06,1:07:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit niya gagawin iyon? Halos hindi ka niya kilala.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.90,1:07:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Kumain ka na lang ng udon mo.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.65,1:07:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit mo nabanggit ang\Nlinisin ang gusali sa kanya?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.86,1:07:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Nabigla ako.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.53,1:07:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Paanong hindi niya alam ang tungkol sa sarili niyang gusali?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.83,1:07:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Ito ba ay katulad ng kung paano ko nakalimutan...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.70,1:07:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,tungkol sa $10 na naiwan ko...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.08,1:07:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,sa aking winter coat?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.50,1:07:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Iyan ba ang pagmamay-ari...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.75,1:07:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- isang building ang para sa kanila...?\N- Tumigil ka na sa pagsasalita!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.25,1:07:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,"Anuman ang dahilan ng inyong hiwalayan,"
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.01,1:07:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,"Naniniwala akong si Hyun-woo ang may kasalanan,"
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.72,1:07:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,"kaya pwede bang maging\Nunderstanding this once,"
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.72,1:07:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,"at hindi makipagdivorce? Umiiyak na emote."
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.14,1:07:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Ipinapadala ko ito.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.32,1:07:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Si Hyun-woo!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.32,1:07:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Baek Hyun-woo{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.40,1:07:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ano ang gagawin ko?\N- Kunin ito.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.99,1:08:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano? Oo, nakilala ko siya.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.74,1:08:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit sa tingin mo ginawa ko?\NTo sabihin sa kanya na huwag kang hiwalayan,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.16,1:08:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,pero masyado siyang abala,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.08,1:08:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,so I texted her instead.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.33,1:08:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ano?\N- Ano?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.96,1:08:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi sila naghihiwalay.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.46,1:08:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- Nagkasundo ba sila?\N- Nagkasundo ba kayo?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.59,1:08:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi, hindi lang niya alam na gusto niya...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.30,1:08:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- isang divorce.\N- Ano?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.38,1:08:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi niya ito dinala.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.51,1:08:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang gagawin ko?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.97,1:08:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Hong Hae-in{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.23,1:08:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Baek Hyun-woo{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.90,1:08:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Power Off{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.50,1:08:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay ka lang?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.00,1:08:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.67,1:08:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Tara na.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.84,1:09:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Anong klaseng tao...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.51,1:09:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,asawa mo ba?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.76,1:09:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Random lang iyon.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.01,1:09:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Palagi kang malamig at naghihinala sa iba,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.43,1:09:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,kaya na-curious ako sa taong...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.89,1:09:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,pinili mong pakasalan.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.02,1:09:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Pag-isipan ko.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.02,1:09:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Parang umaasa ka na sasaktan ko siya,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.94,1:09:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,pero nagkakamali ka. Siya ay isang mabuting tao.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.65,1:09:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakita mo kung paano siya tumalon upang\Niligtas ako sa mapanganib na sandaling iyon.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.62,1:09:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Mali ka.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.83,1:09:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakita ko siyang nag-aalangan.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.20,1:09:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Nag-alinlangan siya...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.91,1:09:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,upang iligtas ka.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.71,1:09:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.13,1:09:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Hong Hae-in{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.64,1:09:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hindi available ang numerong na-dial mo...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.98,1:10:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yan ang pinagkaiba niyong dalawa.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.23,1:10:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Pinapanood mo siya sa sandaling iyon,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.78,1:10:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,pero pinapanood niya ako.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.87,1:10:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Naniniwala ka talaga na mahal ka niya.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.95,1:10:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo, ginagawa ko.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.83,1:10:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ko alam kung ano ang ibig sabihin ng pag-ibig para sa iyo,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.04,1:10:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,pero para sa akin, hindi ito tungkol sa pagiging\Nhappy at pagbulong ng sweet nothings.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.71,1:10:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang pag-ibig ay kapag...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.59,1:10:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,sama-sama ninyong tinitiis ang sakit.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.34,1:10:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Kapag pinili mong manatili sa halip na tumakas.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.35,1:10:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Kahit may utang sila,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.85,1:10:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,o higit pa riyan,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.85,1:10:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,magkadikit pa rin kayo.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.76,1:10:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Pag-ibig yan,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.48,1:10:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,at ginagawa niya iyon.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.03,1:10:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Mahaba iyon.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.47,1:10:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.53,1:10:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Mahilig mag-ramble ang mga tao kapag hindi sila sigurado.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.53,1:10:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Mukhang hindi ka confident.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.49,1:11:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ko alam na nandito ka.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.78,1:11:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Nasaan si Hae-in?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.91,1:11:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, nakikita mo...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.96,1:11:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang nagdadala sa iyo dito?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.92,1:11:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Maraming nainom si Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.17,1:11:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakainom siya?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.47,1:11:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.60,1:11:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hae-in.\N- Pabayaan mo siya. Natutulog siya.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.06,1:12:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Natutulog siya kapag lasing.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.36,1:12:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hong Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.61,1:12:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Natutulog siya buong oras,\Nkaya bigyan mo pa siya ng sampung minuto,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.08,1:12:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,o isasama ko siya mamaya,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.45,1:12:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,para makapaghintay ka sa loob.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.62,1:12:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Gaano karaming alak ang ibinigay mo sa kanya?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.79,1:12:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Paumanhin?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.96,1:12:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Tingnan mo.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.34,1:12:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi siya karaniwang umiinom,\Nngunit kaya niyang hawakan ang kanyang alak,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.55,1:12:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,so magkano ang binigay mo sa kanya, para maging...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.72,1:12:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,lasing ito?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.64,1:12:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Naghalo ako ng alcohol.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.70,1:12:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ako makatulog, masyado kang maingay.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.91,1:12:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Salamat. Umuwi ng ligtas.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.95,1:13:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. Matulog ka ng maayos.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.12,1:13:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- See you tomorrow evening.\N- Bakit siya...?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.84,1:13:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Ibig kong sabihin...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.67,1:13:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Narinig ko na nagkita kayo ni Mr. Hermann ngayon,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.01,1:13:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,so para saan ang bukas?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.30,1:13:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Hindi nagpakita si Hermann ngayon.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.24,1:13:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Tayong dalawa lang,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.39,1:13:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,at uminom kami...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.02,1:13:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,sa ating sarili.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.73,1:13:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama. Huwag kalimutang uminom ng\Norange juice sa umaga.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.57,1:13:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Iyan ang gamot sa hangover mo.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.24,1:13:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.72,1:13:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.74,1:13:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- Bye.\N- Paalam, kung ganoon.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.20,1:13:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Pakialagaan mo siyang mabuti.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.37,1:13:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- Mr. Oh.\N- Yes, sir?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.58,1:13:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Iuwi mo siya ng ligtas.\Nilasing na lasing na siya.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.55,1:13:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Mukhang wala na siya rito,\Nkaya ihatid mo siya sa kanyang pintuan.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.71,1:13:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.88,1:13:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Anong ginagawa mo? Pumasok ka.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.69,1:14:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit bigla kang uminom?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.28,1:14:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Dahil hindi katulad ko.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.03,1:14:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Susubukan ko ang mga bagong bagay.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.00,1:14:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Napaka-unfair.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.00,1:14:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Iba ang pamumuhay ko sa iba kaya\NI ay maaaring mabuhay ng mahaba, malusog na buhay.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.63,1:14:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Pero tingnan mo ako ngayon. Walang silbi ang lahat.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.72,1:14:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Sasabihin ko ang aking isip,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.30,1:14:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,gawin lahat ng gusto ko,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.60,1:14:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,at patayin ang mga karapatdapat dito.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.07,1:14:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with the last one?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.70,1:15:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Papatayin ko...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.32,1:15:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,bawat isang hamak na nagtataksil...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.49,1:15:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,at sinaksak ako sa likod.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.12,1:15:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Pag-isipan ito.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.71,1:15:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Kahit na ako ay pumatay,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.88,1:15:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Kailangan ko lang dumalo sa trial\Na ilang beses bago ako mamatay...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.76,1:15:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,sa tatlong buwan.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.34,1:15:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama. Maaari kang maging abogado ko.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.18,1:15:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, bigyan mo ako niyan. Tara na sa loob.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.40,1:15:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Marunong kang magsabi ng mga nakakatakot na bagay.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.33,1:15:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Huwag kang matakot.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.08,1:15:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Alam kong hindi mo ako ipagkakanulo.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.25,1:15:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Siyempre hindi.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.34,1:15:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ako natatakot.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.76,1:16:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Nga pala,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.27,1:16:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,naka-off ang iyong telepono.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.31,1:16:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Nasaan ito?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.40,1:16:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Wala ito doon?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.77,1:16:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.44,1:16:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Dapat naiwan ko ito sa kotse.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.90,1:16:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Sa kotse?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.36,1:16:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Pumasok ka. Kukunin ko ang iyong telepono.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.62,1:16:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Oh, umalis ka na ba? nasaan ka
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.96,1:16:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano? Eto na.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.09,1:16:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Nasa bulsa ko.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.81,1:16:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano? Naka-off ito.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.31,1:16:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in, teka.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.89,1:17:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- Anong ginagawa mo?\N- Hindi ako sigurado.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.98,1:17:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.81,1:17:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,ako ba...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.73,1:17:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,ginagawa na ngayon?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.78,1:17:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Natutuwa ako...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.44,1:17:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,nahanap mo...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.11,1:17:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,iyong telepono.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.45,1:17:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Maaaring...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.41,1:17:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,abala para makuha ito.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.38,1:17:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit hindi ako...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.88,1:18:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,confident?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.05,1:18:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.76,1:18:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang sinabi mo?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.81,1:18:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.20,1:18:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Sabi ko naman sayo diba?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.41,1:18:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Susubukan ko...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.78,1:18:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,mga bagong bagay.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.94,1:19:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Sanssouci Palace, Potsdam, Germany\NTtatlong Taon ang Nakaraan{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.75,1:19:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Sinabi mo bang walang alalahanin ang lugar na ito?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.67,1:19:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,"Sans souci" sa French ay nangangahulugang "walang pakialam."
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.88,1:19:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakakatawa lang.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.47,1:19:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Paano magkakaroon ng ganoong lugar?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.18,1:19:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Kilala mo ba ang "The Happy Prince"?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.55,1:19:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ang prinsipe na gumawa ng lunok ay dumukit sa kanyang mga mata?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.02,1:19:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.06,1:19:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Naninirahan noon ang prinsipe sa palasyong ito.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.07,1:19:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Isa lang ang napagtanto ko\Npagkatapos kong basahin ang librong iyon...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.57,1:19:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,bilang isang bata.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.99,1:19:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,"Palagi kang magdurusa sa malayo sa bahay."
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.66,1:19:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Malamang na-miss ng prinsipe ang kanyang tahanan.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.20,1:19:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Umalis siya ng bahay para lang magdusa.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.00,1:20:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Ibinigay niya ang kanyang mga hiyas at mata.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.34,1:20:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.30,1:20:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaya siya ang "happy prince."
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.22,1:20:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Pakiusap. Hindi siya masaya. Nagbago lang siya bago siya namatay.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.14,1:20:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Dapat tayong manatiling tapat sa ating sarili,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.26,1:20:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,at hindi kumilos nang wala sa pagkatao\Ndahil lang tayo ay namamatay.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.99,1:20:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Gusto kong gumawa ng isang bagay.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.25,1:20:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Isang cancer support center\Nna tumutulong sa pamilya ng mga empleyado.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.62,1:20:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Paumanhin?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.79,1:20:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Gusto mong mag-alok ng pinansyal\Ntulong sa kanilang mga pamilya?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.96,1:20:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakit?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.84,1:20:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Para sa kahusayan, siyempre.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.92,1:20:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Ano ang ibig mong sabihin?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.51,1:20:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Isipin kung may cancer ang miyembro ng iyong pamilya.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.80,1:20:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Pwede ka bang tumutok sa trabaho?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.30,1:20:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- Malamang hindi.\N- Diba?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.64,1:21:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Kung gayon hindi mo maibebenta ang iyong mga produkto.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.39,1:21:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Iyan ang magiging kawalan ko,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.31,1:21:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,at iiyak ka sa banyo tungkol sa\Nkung paano ka nangangailangan ng pera.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.65,1:21:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Tatakbo ang makeup mo,\Mamaga ang mata mo.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.85,1:21:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Masisira lang nito ang reputasyon ng aming\Ndepartment store.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.97,1:21:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Oo.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.95,1:21:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Hindi ko sinusubukan...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.66,1:21:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,upang tulungan ang iba dahil sa mabuting kalooban.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.74,1:21:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all about the efficiency\Nand the financial aspect.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.04,1:21:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Reyna ng Luha{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.11,1:21:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}- Matutulog ka na ba?\N- Let's do it.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.78,1:22:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Dahil natakot ako. Kaya\Nbakit tumibok ng husto ang puso ko.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.04,1:22:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Ngayong gumaling na ako,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.50,1:22:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}ipagtaksilan mo ba ako?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.54,1:22:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Mag-ingat!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.92,1:22:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Anong klaseng baliw ang sumisigaw ng ganyan dito?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.96,1:22:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Hindi ikaw ang Eun-sung na kilala ko.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.38,1:22:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Nagsumikap akong marinig ito mula sa iyo.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.84,1:22:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Hindi ko rin gusto si Hae-in.\NBakit naman ako magseselos?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.51,1:22:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}May sasabihin ako sa iyo.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.22,1:22:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Huwag mag-alala. Isang magandang balita na magugustuhan mo.{\i0}
